{"version":1,"key":"card:636","content":{"id":636,"content":[{"type":"blockquote","tauContract":"751ccba427a94db9cea481a017ab0a4e94033bd3aa16d3496b70412fe6baf04b","collabId":"5843145a-0cfd-44f5-9c04-6cde3e542957","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0f7d2c12-9f04-4ac8-a0f3-9e557fc2282f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"统计学家乔治·博克斯(George Box)曾说：​“所有模型都是错的，但有些是有用的。​”他的观点是，所有的模型都会做出一系列假设，以简化我们周围的世界；如果它们没有这样做，那么模型和真实世界也就没有什么差别（因此，对理解真实世界也就没有多大帮助）​。那么，关键是要确保你所做的简化假设不会影响问题的答案。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"92ebe986-0a7a-49ff-bed4-11bced5b4bed","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"——《为什么不能多印钱？》，第二章"}]}]}],"tags":[],"createTime":1762737352809,"updateTime":1763047521725,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1763047521725}}